			E.
			<u>Alc.</u>
			294
		</span></i>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφίτῡσα</span> (v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sow, plant, beget,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				235
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				313
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				645
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φιτύσας πατήρ</span>”
