				1.4
			</span></i>; 
				Ep.
			
			2sg.
			fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιτύσεαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.160
				</span></i>
			.</div>
